 regression='First BOUND group remains intact. Omit an already-read dynamic selection/dependency fullproof only from second BOUND group purpose literals and snapshots, with all containing pins rehashed. Require E_GENERATION_PRELUDE after first-stage processing. Existing global omission helper removes all stages and cannot isolate this edge.')
